<section class="outcome" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="outcome-title">
  <div class="ac-measure-intimate outcome__layout">
    <h2 id="outcome-title" class="ac-type-display">What <span class="ac-mark">finished</span> feels like</h2>
    <p class="outcome__body ac-type-body">
      You unlock the door without bracing for what is still undone. The
      approved unwanted contents are gone. The areas included in the scope
      have been cleaned. Important belongings are separated. Known exceptions
      are documented. You can send the realtor, property manager, family
      member, or next occupant inside without first giving them a list of
      unfinished work. You can see the completed condition even when you could
      not be there yourself.
      {" "}
      <strong>The property is no longer following you around. It can move
      forward.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

